# Cholla Check-In — local development
#
# The frontend needs NO environment variables: it auto-detects the Azure
# Functions API at /api and falls back to fictional sample data when it isn't
# there. Server-side settings (the kiosk facilitator code and the storage
# connection string) live in Azure app settings — never in this repository.
#
# For a full local stack, run the SWA CLI which serves the app and the API
# together (see DEPLOYMENT.md):
#
#   npm run dev:swa
#
# and put the API's local settings in api/local.settings.json (gitignored).
